#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:2
#: 83063b82f9c443f098e05e6aad3f9d40
msgid "ADR 0007：大爆炸替换旧 GUI"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:4
#: b46d8b73bfcd4afe950474bf4f3d5f79
msgid "**状态**：已接受 **日期**：2026-08-04 **关联**：ADR 0006（e2m2e GUI 前端定位）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:8
#: 656210bea88841ceb54937928f5f0162
msgid "背景"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:10
#: b5584a21e75240449d2f92f8afae2ea1
msgid ""
"现有 GUI（`tod/gui/`）基于 mixin 架构：`MainWindow` 继承 `FileTreeMixin` + "
"`JobPanelMixin` + `QMainWindow`。通过 QProcess 子进程运行脚本，文件浏览器手动刷新，参数面板从 "
"SCRIPT_ENTRY 自动生成。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:12
#: cbc6abcf73184df68491e67540cd069a
msgid "新 GUI 需要根本不同的架构：Project 数据模型、内嵌可视化、Facade 直调。两种架构差异太大，增量改造不可行。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:14
#: 688e32749f1d42bf8c4050357c77faec
msgid "决策"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:16
#: de2948522d0f4f1abb74636b5f77456f
msgid "**大爆炸替换**：用新的四层架构（model/engine/view/app）完全替代旧的 `tod/gui/`。不做并行双模式，不做原地重构。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:18
#: cb78ba62ac124a149b1c833357f10b34
msgid "理由"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:20
#: 723f3d3b3fea497aabd927c292257f07
msgid "**架构差异不可调和**：旧 GUI 的核心假设是脚本对应进程，新架构是 API 对应线程。这两个假设不兼容。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:21
#: 76b3b93e606b44e2851ebec4ed3dd9d5
msgid ""
"**mixin 限制**：`MainWindow` 的 mixin 链（FileTreeMixin → JobPanelMixin → "
"QMainWindow）使得替换任一组件都需要重构整条继承链。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:22
#: 2a8528f3857f4b98bf42e9da5820e091
msgid ""
"**SCRIPT_ENTRY 废弃**：旧 GUI 的参数面板生成依赖 SCRIPT_ENTRY 扫描，新 GUI 从 Pydantic "
"模型生成。机制完全不同。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:23
#: c9d7d4bbf4734c288a7343514e49c937
msgid "**e2m2e_compat 不再需要**：新架构直接调用 e2m2e 的新 API 路径，不需要旧路径兼容层。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:25
#: fed208eb4142447d8d21164f6337dbce
msgid "后果"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:27
#: ae3480ed3349454582fdc0ea8c88ceff
msgid "正面"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:29
#: 6199025692b44e82a4b67164f6a5696f
msgid "无技术债务继承"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:30
#: bfae5025163b49a291aa43975e8a1caa
msgid "新架构干净，无 mixin 复杂度"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:31
#: 2be4429a148c458285c576d736418632
msgid "代码量大幅减少（删除 40+ 脚本 + scripting 框架 + compat 层）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:33
#: a33ee9a4f1df43b4862c052cd9058cae
msgid "负面"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:35
#: 1e844ea88c8d4810860beeb78cbc8154
msgid "过渡期旧功能不可用（直到新 GUI 覆盖对应能力）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:36
#: d772920488cf476eabf625b5c5ee1b60
msgid "一次性工作量大"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:37
#: f54c950ae622488fad1219cc3aca74b5
msgid "需要重新实现文件发现、设置持久化等基础设施"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:39
#: d53a8bd285294c98848b7c2e1e57d89e
msgid "过渡策略"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:41
#: de868b411b6a47b292e3aabd96ebcdb6
msgid "原型阶段：在 `tod/gui/prototype/` 下验证新架构（已完成）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:42
#: dbd24666edf04082bc58411fe9f26611
msgid ""
"实现阶段：在 `src/model/`、`src/engine/`、`src/view/`、`src/app/` 下实现最终代码（src "
"layout）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:43
#: 304787151c254503b721e98835857b1f
msgid "切换：删除 `tod/gui/`，更新 `pyproject.toml` 入口指向 `src.app.main`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:44
#: bcdfd37fd8e54491b12e68b35973a9f5
msgid ""
"清理：删除 "
"`tod/generates/`、`tod/transfers/`、`tod/scripting/`、`tod/commons/e2m2e_compat.py`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0007-big-bang-gui-replacement.md:45
#: ee10d1d85f2b40959df8fa68067b7374
msgid "收尾：`tod/commons/` 迁入 `src/commons/`，`tod/plot/` 提升为顶层 `plot/`"
msgstr ""

#~ msgid "**架构差异不可调和**：旧 GUI 的核心假设是\"脚本 = 进程\"，新架构是\"API = 线程\"。这两个假设不兼容。"
#~ msgstr ""

